<p style="margin:0 0 24px;max-width:760px;line-height:1.8;text-wrap:pretty">Liberty Hearing Center provides comprehensive hearing evaluations, real-ear verification at every fitting, and the follow-up care needed to make sure your Phonak hearing aids are performing the way they should — in your ears, in your environments, and in your daily life.</p>
